title: MedDial
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent LLM pipeline for generating synthetic patient-physician
  dialogues from clinical notes, with a role-aware, provenance-tracked
  evaluation instrument for measuring dialogue faithfulness and
  knowledge-boundary leakage.
